{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38551","headline":"文德初闻车驾东游 · 吴融","name":"文德初闻车驾东游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙斾丛丛下劒门，还将瑞气入中原。\n鳌头一荡山虽没，乌足重安日不昏。\n晋客已知周礼在，秦人仍喜汉官存。\n自怜闲坐渔矶石，万级云台落梦魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}